    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Manifest Your True Form</p></blockquote><p>A Monk who follows the path of the Astral Self believes their body is an illusion and sees their Focus as a representation of their true form, an astral self. This astral self can be a force of order or disorder: some monasteries train students to use its power to protect the weak, others teach aspirants to manifest their true selves in the service of the mighty. The astral self is a translucent embodiment of the Monk's soul; it can reflect their background, ideals, flaws, and bonds, and it needn't look anything like the Monk.</p><p><em>Way of the Astral Self of Tasha's Cauldron of Everything, adapted to the 2024 rules by Owidyn (Ki becomes Focus Points).</em></p><h3>Warrior of the Astral Self Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.9on9cjAAWk8APGgE]{Arms of the Astral Self}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.lQTCbiHJjfrLG3gg]{Visage of the Astral Self}</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.MMWYn6fOAmI8l76i]{Body of the Astral Self}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.ydyqXCkeGYZcBzLK]{Awakened Astral Self}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
